# Tokamak Pilot — Project Overview

This is a **pnpm monorepo** managed by **Turborepo** for a RAG-powered knowledge hub for the Tokamak Network ecosystem.

## Monorepo Structure

- `apps/api` — NestJS 11 backend (REST API, port 4000)
- `apps/web` — Next.js 15 frontend (React 19, port 3000)
- `packages/shared` — Shared TypeScript types, constants (imported as `@tokamak-pilot/shared`)
- `packages/sdk` — Public TypeScript SDK (`@tokamak-pilot/sdk`)
- `packages/eslint-config` — Shared ESLint config

## Commands

- `pnpm dev` — Runs both API + Web in parallel (single command)
- `pnpm build` — Builds everything
- `pnpm --filter @tokamak-pilot/api dev` — Run only the API
- `pnpm --filter @tokamak-pilot/web dev` — Run only the frontend

## Key Conventions

- All shared types go in `packages/shared/src/types.ts`, not duplicated across apps
- Environment variables are defined in root `.env` (see `.env.example`)
- API endpoints are prefixed with `/api/v1`
- Swagger docs are auto-generated at `http://localhost:4000/docs`
